    <string name="ai_card_desc">Get quick guidance on meditation, chakras, stress and sleep, any time.</string>
    <string name="ai_hint">Ask about meditation, chakras, stress…</string>
    <string name="ai_intro_title">🙏 Namaste! I am Swamiji AI</string>
    <string name="ai_intro_body">I am still learning from Swamiji\'s teachings, so for now I share general guidance. For a personal answer, ask Swamiji directly.</string>
    <string name="ai_ask_real">Chat or call with Swamiji →</string>
    <string name="ai_dev_note">✨ Swamiji AI is under development. Soon it will answer from Swamiji\'s own teachings.</string>
    <string name="ai_suggest_meditation">How do I start meditating?</string>
    <string name="ai_suggest_stress">I feel stressed</string>
    <string name="ai_suggest_chakra">What are chakras?</string>
    <string name="ai_suggest_sleep">I can\'t sleep well</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_meditation">Start small: sit comfortably for 5 minutes at the same time each day. Close your eyes, breathe slowly and simply watch the breath. When thoughts come, gently return to the breath. The morning practice videos in the Spiritual tab guide you step by step.</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_chakra">Chakras are seven energy centres along the spine, from the root (Muladhara) to the crown (Sahasrara). When they are balanced, body and mind feel light and steady. Watch the Body Chakras and Kundalini videos in the Spiritual tab to learn each one.</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_stress">Try box breathing now: breathe in for 4 counts, hold for 4, breathe out for 4, hold for 4. Repeat 5 times. Stress loosens when the breath slows. Doing the morning practice daily builds calm that lasts.</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_sleep">Before bed, keep the phone away for 30 minutes. Lie down, relax each part of the body from the toes to the head, and give thanks for three things from your day. The night practice videos help the mind settle into sleep.</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_healing">Self-healing begins with steady breath and a calm mind. Practise daily, rest well and follow your doctor\'s advice for any illness. The Self Healing Course videos in the Spiritual tab show the methods Swamiji teaches.</string>
    <string name="ai_answer_protection">Do the protection practice each morning: imagine a bright light around you, breathe calmly and feel safe inside it. Keep positive company and thoughts. The Spiritual Protection Meditation videos guide you through it.</string>
